// Heading shape for the open-questions register. The `md-open-questions` hook in
// ../.pre-commit-config.yaml owns which documents this applies to.
//
// One H1 and nothing else. The register's per-question headings are dynamic, so the
// shape gates the top level only; `cog docs-lint` owns the per-question fields.
{
  "config": {
    "MD043": {
      "headings": ["*"]
    }
  }
}
